{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Only flesh with its life.</b> Only the flesh of a living creature while it is still alive — <b>בְּנַפְשׁוֹ</b> (with its life) meaning while it is living." "<b>Its blood.</b> And likewise its blood, which it discharges while it is still alive." "<b>You shall not eat.</b> But what is discharged from a dead creature was permitted to the children of Noah."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:33.415276220Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}